# "Descend 8 - At the beginning of your upkeep, if there are eight or more permanent cards in your graveyard, transform" has an
# intervening "if" (CR 603.4): it is checked as the ability would trigger, and again as it resolves. Turn 5's upkeep has eight
# permanent cards in Bot1's graveyard (the Island Bot1 milled on turn 1 and seven more Breaking milled on turn 3), so it triggers;
# Bot2 answers with Tormod's Crypt, exiling that graveyard, and when the ability resolves the condition is false: the Well does
# nothing and stays an artifact.

