Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
The Everflowing Well
Breaking // Entering
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island
Island x7
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Island x20

